# MuffMode

Quake II Rerelease server-side multiplayer mod (C++ game DLL). Primary dev branch: `muffdev` / `ozdev`.

## Architecture

- **Thin vanilla hooks**: keep `g_*.cpp`, `p_*.cpp`, etc. as small wrappers; put MuffMode logic in `src/muffmode/`.
- **New features** → new `mm_<feature>.{h,cpp}`, declare API in the header, add `#include "mm_<feature>.h"` to `src/muffmode/muffmode.h` (alphabetical), wire `src/game.vcxproj` + `.filters`.
- **Player prefs** → `client_config_t` (`sess.pc` in `g_local.h`), not raw userinfo. Commands: thin `Cmd_*_f` in `g_cmds.cpp` → `MM_Cmd*` in the module.
- **Cvars** → register in `g_main.cpp`, `extern` in `g_local.h`. Document in `docs/configuration-reference.md` when user-facing.
- **Minimize scope**: match surrounding style; no drive-by refactors.

## Build & test

From repo root, in a VS 2022 developer shell:

```powershell
./scripts/ci/build-msbuild.ps1 -Configuration Release -Platform x64 -TreatWarningsAsErrors
```

Local quick build: `build.bat`. See `docs/build-guide.md`.

## Commits

- Only commit when explicitly asked.
- One-line subject, repo style: `area: what changed; bump X.Y.Z.` (e.g. `mm_skin: add per-viewer eskin/tskin; bump 0.36.31.`).
- Never amend pushed commits; never skip hooks unless asked.

## Versioning (required for every shipped change)

**Source of truth:** repo-root `VERSION` and `GAMEMOD_VERSION` in `src/g_local.h` must always match.

```cpp
constexpr const char *GAMEMOD_VERSION = "0.36.33";  // src/g_local.h
```

```text
0.36.33   # VERSION (no v prefix, no trailing newline issues)
```

### Day-to-day dev commits

1. Bump **patch** (`0.36.32` → `0.36.33`) in **both** files together.
2. Mention the bump in the commit message.
3. Do not change `GAMEVERSION` (`baseq2`) — only `GAMEMOD_VERSION` / `VERSION`.

### Release / automated bump

Use `scripts/release.ps1` (see `docs/release-process.md`):

```powershell
# Align files to next patch without building
.\scripts\release.ps1 -VersionMode patch -UpdateVersionFiles -SkipBuild -AllowDirtyPackage

# Or exact version
.\scripts\release.ps1 -Version 0.37.0 -UpdateVersionFiles -SkipBuild -AllowDirtyPackage
```

`-VersionMode auto|major|minor|patch` picks semver from git history. Releases block if `VERSION` ≠ `GAMEMOD_VERSION`.

### Checklist before finishing version work

- [ ] `VERSION` updated
- [ ] `src/g_local.h` `GAMEMOD_VERSION` matches exactly
- [ ] Commit message includes `bump X.Y.Z`

## Docs

